|----|------------|--------------------|--------------------|
| C1 | ORT vs ORT, identical session, run-to-run | maxdiff 0 | maxdiff 0 |
| C2 | ORT graph-opt level `DISABLE_ALL`/`BASIC` vs `ALL` | ≤ 1e-4 | 1e-3–1e-2 class |
